@startuml
[*] --> "Keyword Entered"
"Keyword Entered" --> "Query Generated" : Enter first keyword
"Query Generated" --> "Additional Keywords Entered" : Add more keywords
"Additional Keywords Entered" --> "Combined Query Generated" : Combine keywords
"Combined Query Generated" --> "Search Performed" : Perform search
"Search Performed" --> "Results Displayed" : Display results
"Results Displayed" --> [*] : End process
"Results Displayed" --> "Additional Keywords Entered" : Refine search
@enduml
